// Negative case: secretH is internal to the sibling-std module helper, so
// using it from the entry must make the VisibilityChecker emit the
// `is internal to project` diagnostic and exit(1). Compiling this file is
// expected to FAIL with that diagnostic and non-zero exit; the diagnostic
// text must be byte-identical before and after the ladder-unification +
// shared-text change (the checker now sees the same sibling-std file the
// driver collected).
import helper;

void main() {
    int total = helper.secretH();
    printline(total);
}
